This guide is designed to train GitHub Copilot to develop and expand the BGIN AVIS language. It establishes a recursive, oracle-based development cycle where Copilot builds the grammar by prompting the "demon" (Joe) for specific architectural decisions.
BGIN AVIS Language Development Guide
Target Agent: GitHub Copilot (Language Architect Mode)
Environment: Linux GitHub OS / Sentinel Custom Kernel
Release Date: February 3, 2026